# The form of "год" that a count of years ending in two, three or four takes:
# "102 года назад" is 102 years ago.
# Source: en.wiktionary.org, "два", Russian usage notes: два and две, "when
# in the nominative case or accusative case", "even in compounds (22, 32,
# 42, 102, etc.)", "govern the genitive of the noun"; "Три (Tri) and четы́ре
# (četýre) obey the same rules."  Example under "год": "Ему́ два́дцать три
# го́да."
года
